        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/ByFFBWeTFjeV0vTYlJZMoJOTOWT5KowSxBTAojjhe7JsmuxXWjNRJdo6odK5WEu6Q7aqr8vGIfc5l_-PeKaIkZ4tUzPYJ7ZI6emXhnlcaO7o9KBcqml1k-l7rdzyoV13j8VgU0lzew3vdIKA0if-ndDoN8u2UeDgJ9OdmyLeuVfWFmg7c7l8ksSPlkVnyP4tJ2xc6GGBRJKrofOz9cr2FQmT9986_cZnjMsHWKdSTrbNAr-QX05-51lXJ_Gwos6aziPaTVuFWclxPJpNH9TF5Oast25E5kcl4JYxk8l2dXyaXbAapgJFPXsQBiuv_c0WGfFeMpdjpgJToKCHYQHF3Q.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "it:giuseppemasala",
